"a default name will not overwrite names for specific languages that you have "
"already set.</li><li>The category prefix has to be made up of two letters and "
"an underscore (like: <b>sp_</b> or <b>ws_</b>).</li><li>Pictures that you want "
"to appear in a specific category have to be named with that prefix like: "
