"By default, %s is provided with several color schemes, and so long as the site "
"administrator has not disabled them, they will appear in this dropdown list. "
"You can select a theme to your preference, that will change elements such as "
"page color, background images, etc. These themes will only affect your "
"experience on %s and will make no changes to your internet browser or computer."
